a-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (compatibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" href=\"?note=2ad4b32e9e2eb12a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md\">../batch08/58-df-compatible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8QuotientForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8QuotientForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8QuotientForcing}_S(R,Q,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists M,\\leq_Q,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land P\\subseteq Q\\land\\leq_P=\\leq_Q\\cap(P\\times P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\land R=\\{q\\in Q:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(q,p,Q,\\leq_Q)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8QuotientForcing}_S(R,Q,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists M,\\leq_Q,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land P\\subseteq Q\\land\\leq_P=\\leq_Q\\cap(P\\times P)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\land R=\\{q\\in Q:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Compatible}_S(q,p,Q,\\leq_Q)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary quotient forcing definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-compatible.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad4b32e9e2eb12a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-compatible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (generic-filter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.